make it real.
Stability (Colpa’s theorem [42]).IfM k >0 (posi-
tive definite), thenD=τ zMis similar to the Hermitian
matrixM 1/2τzM1/2 of signature (2,2), soDis diago-
nalizable with a real spectrum of two positive and two
