When the asymptotic dynamics are contracting at a single Lyapunov scale, our
main theorem shows any ergodic stationary measure is exact dimensional, with
dimension determined by the Furstenberg entropy and the Lyapunov exponent.
Theorem 1.Letνbe a Borel probability measure onDiff 1(M)such thatf7→
log[f]C1 + log[f−1]C1 belongs toL 1(ν). Supposeµis aν-stationary ergodic Borel
probability measure onMand there isλ<0such thatλ top =λ bot =λ.Thenµis
