In order to estimate Furstenberg entropy, we will approximate Radon-Nikodym
derivatives by quotients of ball measures, and use a Maker’s theorem-type argument.
The next lemma verifies the necessary integrability hypotheses to do so. The proof
is a modification of [15, Lemma 8.3] and [18, Lemma 9] from their projective setting.
