Abstract.We prove exact dimensionality of ergodic stationary measures for
randomC 1 diffeomorphisms in the single negative Lyapunov scale setting.
Letνbe a Borel probability measure on Diff 1(M) satisfying a logarithmicC 1
moment condition, and letµbe aν-stationary ergodic probability measure. If
λtop =λ bot =λ<0,thenµis exact dimensional and dim(µ) =h F
µ(ν)/(−λ).
No discreteness assumption is imposed on the driving measure.
