Shack-Hartmann Wavefront Sensors in Strong Turbulence
Sam J. Potier a, Arlene J. Alem´ ana, Justin R. Crepp a, and Stanimir Letchev a, b
aUniversity of Notre Dame, Department of Physics and Astronomy, Notre Dame, IN 46656,
