The kinematics of tadpole galaxies at intermediate redshiftz∼0.4−1.5
Manish Kataria
 ,1,∗ Kanak Saha
 ,1,† and Bruce Elmegreen
 2
1Inter-University Centre for Astronomy and Astrophysics, Pune 411007, India.
