erally faint and compact, and the emission-line signal-
to-noise ratio is insufficient in many individual MUSE
spaxels to obtain robust kinematic measurements across
the full spatial extent of the galaxy. Consequently, the
two-dimensional maps can contain large spaxel-to-spaxel
