lution and signal-to-noise of the observations.
Because several galaxies are only marginally resolved
with MUSE, the observed pseudo-slit velocity profiles
can be affected by beam smearing. We therefore
compare the measured velocities with a simple PSF-
convolved kinematic model. For each slit orientation,
an intrinsic line-of-sight velocity profile is generated and
convolved with the MUSE PSF before being sampled at
the same projected positions as the observations.
