∆v=|v outer,1−v outer,2|(2)
wherev outer,1 andv outer,2 are the velocity measure-
ments at the largest reliable projected distances on
opposite sides of the [Oii] center. We calculate this
quantity independently along the morphological major
axis, ∆v major, and along the perpendicular direction,
∆vminor. The asymmetric uncertainties are propagated
from the corresponding uncertainties on the two outer
velocity measurements using theadd asymcode (Barlow
2003; Laursen et al. 2019).
