So far, the physical nature of the Markov states has not been
specified. The schematic shown in Figure 1 suggests interpret-
ing the Markov process as diffusion on a discretized potential
landscape. Introducing a lattice spacingδxbetween neighbor-
ing states and a time incrementδ τ, we expand the probabili-
tiespand transition matrix elementsπof the master equation
