the Markov models considered in the following can also be
viewed as a discretized version of overdamped diffusive dy-
namics in a one-dimensional, time-dependent potential land-
scapeH(x,τ). This interpretation guided our choice of model
systems (section III) and links them to biophysical applica-
tions such as barrier crossing and optical-trap experiments.
