at timeτ=N+1. This system is a toy model of the optical-
trap setups studied in previous works [32, 37, 38], where the
trap center was shifted in finite time. The crucial difference
from these studies is that our approach does not impose any
shape of the potential landscape on the intermediate Hamilto-
nians. We determined the optimal intermediates for all com-
binations ofN∈{10,20,50,100},m∈{3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10},
andδ∈{1,2,3,4,5}, amounting to 160 cases. All numer-
ically determined optimal intermediates are provided in the
